{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/Overworld.yarn-removeOracleDeck-8171": "轰",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/lanetesPuzzles.yarn-pipeGame_checkDebug-8172": "解开谜题了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/lanetesPuzzles.yarn-lanetesPuzzle3aButton-8173": "声音从哪儿传来的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fortThermeLT-8174": "LIEUTENANT: 卢斯基亚人一直在试探我们的防线，巡逻稍有疏漏，就可能害死所有人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fortThermeLT-8175": "LIEUTENANT: 别再想着那些没能治好的士兵了，那对谁都没用。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeGate1-8176": "SOLDIER: 我们被困死在这儿了，除非你们看见有几个师来救援，不然只是时间问题……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeGate2-8177": "SOLDIER: 三个月了，不是在撤退，就是在挨炮，至少这里还有个地方睡觉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeGate2-8178": "SOLDIER: 我屁股上刚又挨了弹片。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeGate2-8179": "SOLDIER: 已经无所谓了，眼下除非死了，根本不让你退下来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeMan1-8180": "MAN: 还以为这场战争不会波及我呢，算我白想。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeMan1-8181": "MAN: 现在该我们这些人干活了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeMan1-8182": "MAN: 你会玩神谕牌？真的？能陪我来一局吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeMan1-8183": "不了，谢谢",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeMan1-8184": "来一局！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeMan1-8185": "MAN: 玩得很开心，谢谢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeMan1-8186": "MAN: 这是我在战场上捡的，交给你最合适。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeMan1-8187": "获得半影锁甲！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeMan1-8188": "MAN: 这一仗是我赢了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeGirl1-8189": "GIRL: 有些士兵进了树林，就再也没回来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeGirl1-8190": "GIRL: 等他们全都没了，会怎么样？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeGirl1-8191": "GIRL: 现在树林里会有幽灵吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeWoman2-8192": "WOMAN: 军官们不肯停下来跟我们说话，甚至不肯与我们对视……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeWoman2-8193": "WOMAN: 请原谅，哪怕只是暂时的，我还是松了口气。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeOldWoman1-8194": "OLD WOMAN: 早就知道这场仗只会惹祸，真是愚蠢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeOldWoman1-8195": "OLD WOMAN: 死在那一仗里的人，每一个都有母亲。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeSoldier3-8196": "SOLDIER: 像这样的村子，我们已经丢下不少了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeSoldier3-8197": "SOLDIER: 又一场仗罢了，打久了，哪场是哪场都分不清。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeSoldier2-8198": "SOLDIER: 我跑够了，不管什么结果，赶紧了结吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fEatingSoldier-8199": "SOLDIER: 他那儿什么都快没了，可他们又出不去，没法进田里和树林找吃的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fOrderSoldier-8200": "SOLDIER: 那……还剩什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeSeller-8201": "OLD MAN: 再过一周，这些钱还有没有用，我都说不准。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeSeller-8202": "OLD MAN: 国家还没垮，就等着看吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fSpringsSoldier1-8203": "SOLDIER: 我可不想以这种方式来温泉镇。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fSpringsSoldier1-8204": "SOLDIER: 但愿能和主力部队会合。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fSpringsSoldier1-8205": "SOLDIER: 就算是卢斯基亚人，也总有把人打光的时候。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fSpringsSoldier2-8206": "SOLDIER: 那帮卢斯基亚人还要让我们等多久？要打就打，不打就滚。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fShelterSoldier1-8207": "SOLDIER: 这是我们的后撤防线，可真让他们打到这里，也没什么用了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fShelterSoldier1-8208": "SOLDIER: 军服上多了几个弹孔，钢盔上也有一个。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fShelterSoldier1-8209": "SOLDIER: 看来还没轮到我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fShelterSoldier2-8210": "SOLDIER: 军官说在这里能汲取魔力，可我们连挺机枪都没有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermePost3-8211": "SOLDIER: 从这个方向进攻很蠢，可他们就爱这么干。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermePost3-8212": "SOLDIER: 他们大多就是靠人多压垮我们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermePost3-8213": "SOLDIER: 你们干的事不知道犯了多少条法，不过我可不会抱怨。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermePost4-8214": "SOLDIER: 他们的炮肯定也不多，不然我们早死了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermePost1-8215": "SOLDIER: 我们朝几个侦察兵开过枪，可上头让停，除非他们打中了防护结界。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermePost1-8216": "SOLDIER: 跟我一起来的那些人，现在不是死了，就是受了伤。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermePost1-8217": "SOLDIER: 我一直想不明白，为什么遭殃的偏偏不是我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermePost2-8218": "SOLDIER: 军官们正在布置陷阱和结界。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermePost1a-8219": "SOLDIER: 目前他们还没从田里过来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermePost1a-8220": "SOLDIER: 大部队从那边走最快，可也会暴露无遗。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeMarketWoman-8221": "WOMAN: 几乎什么都不剩了，要是能出去下田就好了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeMarketWoman-8222": "WOMAN: 我就等指挥官准许我们出去割麦子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeBoy-8223": "BOY: 什么时候才能再出去玩？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeBoy-8224": "BOY: 坏人走了，能去摘苹果了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeGirl-8225": "GIRL: 这个呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeGirl-8226": "GIRL: 士兵没有之前那么多了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeOldman-8227": "OLD MAN: 听起来，也没比上次大战的战壕好到哪儿去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeOldman-8228": "OLD MAN: 我们把那孩子葬在了我家的墓地。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeOldman-8229": "OLD MAN: 至少，他安息在了故乡的土地上。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeTalkingSoldier-8230": "SOLDIER: 我们那边就是在严寒里没完没了地行军，为了绕到敌人侧面，白天走，晚上还得走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeTalkingSoldier-8231": "SOLDIER: 后来开始撤退，有人走着走着就倒进了雪堆，我们却只能把他们留在那里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeApproachScene-8232": "NIKOLAI: 等等，不对劲。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeApproachScene-8233": "NIKOLAI: 每年这时候，大家都该在田里收硬红麦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeApproachScene-8234": "NIKOLAI: 敌情！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeApproachScene-8235": "NIKOLAI: 找掩护！我们闯进包围圈了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeApproachScene-8236": "CORDELIA: 这么大的雾，他们应该打不中我们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeApproachScene-8237": "NIKOLAI: 在空中时，我们本该看到敌军阵地……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeApproachScene-8238": "JEROME: 他们一定藏在树下，或者也用了魔法掩护。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeApproachScene-8239": "SOLDIER: 他们来了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeApproachScene-8240": "SOLDIER: 那到底是什么人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeApproachScene-8241": "SOLDIER: 进攻！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeApproachScene-8242": "CORDELIA: 范围这么大，这个法术维持不了多久。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeApproachScene-8243": "NIKOLAI: 奥斯伦的防线应该就在村口附近。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-enterFortifiedTherme-8244": "SOLDIER: 口令！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-enterFortifiedTherme-8245": "NIKOLAI: 我不知道。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-enterFortifiedTherme-8246": "NIKOLAI: 能叫位军官来确认我们的身份吗？我们就在这里等。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-enterFortifiedTherme-8247": "SOLDIER: 中尉！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-enterFortifiedTherme-8248": "LIEUTENANT: 他们是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-enterFortifiedTherme-8249": "LIEUTENANT: 肯定不是卢斯基亚人……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-enterFortifiedTherme-8250": "NIKOLAI: 我是这个村的人，尼古拉·普罗赫。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-enterFortifiedTherme-8251": "JEROME: （这样报上身份妥当吗？他们对你的看法，恐怕没变。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-enterFortifiedTherme-8252": "NIKOLAI: 真被包围了，他们还有更大的麻烦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-enterFortifiedTherme-8253": "LIEUTENANT: 去旅店外面向上校报到，别干蠢事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermePacer1-8254": "TECH: 只有步枪弹药、几枚手榴弹[oxfordComma /]还有二十米左右的铁丝，就这些。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermePacer1-8255": "TECH: 真不敢相信我还活着，这样的运气撑不了多久。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeEavesEng-8256": "TECH: 连台能用的旧拖拉机都没有……什么都没有！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeBriefLT-8257": "LIEUTENANT: 沿着崖边撤不出去？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeBriefLT-8258": "LIEUTENANT: 现在不用护送平民了，你觉得我们有几成胜算？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeSgt-8259": "SERGEANT: 侦察兵都说，走那边只会挤成一团，任人当靶子打。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeSgt-8260": "SERGEANT: 尤其还带着平民，根本没有合适的撤退路线。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeSgt-8261": "SERGEANT: 西北有条通道，能让我们与第三集团军会合。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeSgt-8262": "SERGEANT: 可弟兄们还剩多少力气打仗，我也说不准。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8263": "NIKOLAI: 你一定就是指挥……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8264": "NIKOLAI: 阿尔特迈尔？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8265": "ALTMAYER: 普罗赫，还真是你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8266": "NIKOLAI: 升得挺快啊，上尉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8267": "ALTMAYER: 打起仗来就是这样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8268": "ALTMAYER: 听说你突破敌军防线的时候，闹出了不小的阵仗。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8269": "NIKOLAI: 这里情况怎么样？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8270": "ALTMAYER: 我手里只有一个连的残部，卢斯基亚人却有一两个团。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8271": "ALTMAYER: 全靠地形和天气才撑到现在，他们似乎没能把那些一百二十二毫米的大炮拖上坡。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8272": "ALTMAYER: 不过有几门七十六毫米榴弹炮，已经瞄上我们了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8273": "ALTMAYER: 按理说，第六师的援军一周前就该到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8274": "NIKOLAI: 那我得告诉你个坏消息，我们从空中过来，放眼望去，没见到任何人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8275": "ALTMAYER: 那就意味着我们——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8276": "OFFICER: 尼古拉·普罗赫！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8277": "OFFICER: 叛徒！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8278": "ALTMAYER: 长官，现在不是——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8279": "OFFICER: 让开，上校。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8280": "OFFICER: 以叛国罪逮捕你！胆敢逃跑，就在此当场执行死刑！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8281": "NIKOLAI: 有本事就试试。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8282": "OFFICER: 我正有此意。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8283": "NIKOLAI: 还有谁想碰运气？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8284": "ALTMAYER: 总理的代表命令我们站到一边，大家都听见了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8285": "CORDELIA: 哦？原来你们也信奉法律、体面[oxfordComma /]还有克制！只不过，仅限于对自己的同胞。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8286": "ALTMAYER: 请恕我冒昧，你说什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8287": "CORDELIA: 你得不到我的宽恕，它早就在你们点的火里烧光了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8288": "ALTMAYER: 她在说什么？斯特拉尔？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8289": "NIKOLAI: 听着，干那些事的不是这些人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8290": "CORDELIA: 不是吗？我看你是闭着眼睛不肯看。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8291": "CORDELIA: 也许给他们一个更无力反抗的目标，他们就会重新露出嗜血本性。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8292": "CORDELIA: 可一见识到我们的本事，他们就戴上羊的面具，遮住那副沾着血的嘴脸。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8293": "CORDELIA: 我没兴趣帮你们这些战犬爬出自己挖的坑。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8294": "CORDELIA: 祝你好运，也祝这些不幸的农民好运。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8295": "JEROME: 你怎么出去？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8296": "CORDELIA: 怎么进来的，就怎么出去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8297": "ALTMAYER: 我会管好其他部下，过几分钟来找我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8298": "NIKOLAI: 姑且算是一次“战术胜利”吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-colonelAltmayer-8299": "NIKOLAI: 我先走开一会儿，行吗？有点……事要办。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeBlocking-8300": "SOLDIER: 你最好别进旅店。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeBlocking-8301": "SOLDIER: 有些士兵不赞成让你留在这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeBlocking-8302": "SOLDIER: 就算看见你使了那么多魔法，还是有不少人看你不顺眼。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-fThermeBlocking-8303": "SOLDIER: 他们也许威胁不到你，可我不想看他们犯傻。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8304": "DIETRICH: 都说了，没有面粉，我什么也——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8305": "DIETRICH: 尼科！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8306": "DIETRICH: 我……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8307": "DIETRICH: 他们说你……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8308": "DIETRICH: 吃过了吗？看着倒没饿着，反正比驻在这儿的部队吃得好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8309": "DIETRICH: 抱歉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8310": "DIETRICH: 他们说你失踪了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8311": "DIETRICH: 我还藏了几个炸圈饼，放到现在都陈得不像样了，可……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8312": "DIETRICH: 等等，刚才外面是你？那些陌生人是和你一起的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8313": "NIKOLAI: 对，都是我的战友，我的朋友。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8314": "NIKOLAI: 我们不是来惹事的，是来帮忙的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8315": "NIKOLAI: 至少大多数是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8316": "DIETRICH: 放心，我就知道总会有人收拾那个可恶的情报官和他的爪牙。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8317": "DIETRICH: 尼科，你还不知道他们有多过分呢！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8318": "DIETRICH: 村子被围得水泄不通，那些“特别部队”却在挨家挨户搜地窖！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8319": "DIETRICH: 你想想，审问一群农民！他们以为我们的民族精神是从哪儿来的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8320": "NIKOLAI: 他们，呃……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8321": "NIKOLAI: 他们干过比这恶劣得多的事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8322": "DIETRICH: 真不像话，这场战争让那么多坏种混到了总理身边。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8323": "NIKOLAI: 什么？不是，那些事就是总理下令干的，还有更糟的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8324": "DIETRICH: 尼科，你好不容易回家，我不想吵架。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8325": "DIETRICH: 战争年代，身居高位的疯子当然会有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8326": "DIETRICH: 可你得继续相信总理，想想他为这个国家创造了多少奇迹。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8327": "DIETRICH: 他让我们重拾民族自豪，也让我们的文化重归纯正！我们得把希望寄托在他身上，撑到他再次取胜。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8328": "DIETRICH: 你还好吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8329": "DIETRICH: 等太阳下山，我也许能烤个小乡村面包让你带上。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8330": "DIETRICH: 只是不能让他们看到我开炉，不然连剩下这点东西都得被没收。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8331": "NIKOLAI: 谢谢，爸。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich-8332": "NIKOLAI: （该再去找阿尔特迈尔了……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeCommanderFirst-8333": "NIKOLAI: 先去见指挥官吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich2-8334": "DIETRICH: 你上战场之前，我看看能不能给你弄点吃的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich2-8335": "DIETRICH: 看了你刚才的本事，我想也不用太担心你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-c11dietrich2-8336": "DIETRICH: 记着，给我们大家争口气。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeMission-8337": "JEROME: 一共有几个人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeMission-8338": "ALTMAYER: 只有三个，可只要还有人活着、没被抓，我们就得知道他们看到了什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeMission-8339": "NIKOLAI: 怎么回事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeMission-8340": "JEROME: 他们似乎派了一队侦察兵上山。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeMission-8341": "ALTMAYER: 他们去了山腰的村子，我以为从那里能看清敌人的动向。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeMission-8342": "ALTMAYER: 两天前就该回来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeMission-8343": "NIKOLAI: 那段路不好爬，除非以前走过。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeMission-8344": "ALTMAYER: 你走过？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeMission-8345": "NIKOLAI: 我年轻那阵，呃，去那里见过一个姑娘。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeMission-8346": "ALTMAYER: 你倒是很会突破卢斯基亚人的防线，能爬上去，找到我的侦察兵吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeMission-8347": "NIKOLAI: 总比坐等他们进攻强。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeMission-8348": "NIKOLAI: 上崖的老路，就在后面温泉的西边。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeMission-8349": "ALTMAYER: 那就祝你好运。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-AgataInTherme-8350": "AGATA: 守护者训练时追求的是最快的速度和隐蔽行动。防御工事，对我们来说只学过理论。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-AgataInTherme-8351": "AGATA: 总不会比之前遇到的更糟吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-AlexJunaTherme-8352": "ALEXANDRA: 那个……怎么样？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-AlexJunaTherme-8353": "JUNA: 不错。你下来吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-AlexJunaTherme-8354": "ALEXANDRA: 当着这么多人的面……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-AlexJunaTherme-8355": "JUNA: 明天要是把这里炸个粉碎，我可舍不得。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-AlexJunaTherme-8356": "JUNA: 我现在有点迷上泡温泉了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-benInTherme-8357": "BEN: 打完还得多待一天，好尝尝你吹了半天的面包。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-benInTherme-8358": "BEN: 所以……敌军到底有多少人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-AltmayerL-8359": "ALTMAYER: 侦察兵要是观察了好几天，应该能摸清敌人的部署。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-AltmayerL-8360": "ALTMAYER: 能歇就尽量歇会儿吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeScene-8361": "JEROME: 没看到侦察兵。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeScene-8362": "NIKOLAI: 村民也不见了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeScene-8363": "AGATA: 会不会已经撤走了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeScene-8364": "NIKOLAI: 山上有些老人，不管谁打进来都不会走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeScene-8365": "NIKOLAI: 可家里一个人也没有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeScene-8366": "JUNA: 我闻到一股味儿……是火药。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeBarn-8367": "NIKOLAI: 他们……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeBarn-8368": "NIKOLAI: 有尸体吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeBarn-8369": "AGATA: 别去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeBarn-8370": "AGATA: 你认识这里的人。我替你看。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeBarn-8371": "NIKOLAI: 我开始觉得，卢斯基亚人对这场战争的恨意，远比想象中深。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeBarn-8372": "JEROME: 如果他们知道我们所知的一半，也不难理解原因。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeBarn-8373": "AGATA: 找到那些士兵了。这里还住着多少人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeBarn-8374": "NIKOLAI: 很久没来了。大概……二十五个？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeBarn-8375": "AGATA: 尸体都在里面。除了女人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeBarn-8376": "ALEXANDRA: 那是好事吧？至少他们放过了女人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeBarn-8377": "ALEXANDRA: 哦。不……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeBarn-8378": "NIKOLAI: 回去向上校报告吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeBarn-8379": "NIKOLAI: 我们可以……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeBarn-8380": "NIKOLAI: ……打完之后，会有人来安葬他们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeBackoff-8381": "AGATA: 现在别去。于事无补。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberDoor1-8382": "有人吗？有人在家吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberDoor2-8383": "门被钉死了，看起来没有人在家。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeAmbush-8384": "JUNA: 听见了吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeAmbush-8385": "AGATA: 我不认为他们能绕到我们身后，还不被发现。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeAmbush-8386": "NIKOLAI: 我刚加入边防部队时，就听说卢斯基亚有个来自腹地的部族。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeAmbush-8387": "NIKOLAI: 卢斯基亚军方很喜欢用这个部族的人当侦察兵。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeAmbush-8388": "NIKOLAI: 因为那些族人会一种古老法术，只要踩在雪上，就能隐去身形……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeAmbush-8389": "NIKOLAI: 他们准备进攻了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-oberthermeAmbush-8390": "NIKOLAI: 回村子去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-altmayerNight-8391": "ALTMAYER: 没看见侦察兵，看来不顺利？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-altmayerNight-8392": "NIKOLAI: 是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-altmayerNight-8393": "NIKOLAI: 卢斯基亚人不会放过村里的任何人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-altmayerNight-8394": "ALTMAYER: 哨兵发现林间有动静，还有几处结界被大规模行动触发。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-altmayerNight-8395": "ALTMAYER: 他们大概会在黎明进攻。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-altmayerNight-8396": "NIKOLAI: 如果你们真打算留下来……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-altmayerNight-8397": "NIKOLAI: 可以睡我爸家，算不上舒服，不过今晚能凑合。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-turnInFortTherme-8398": "休息到天亮？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-turnInFortTherme-8399": "否",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-turnInFortTherme-8400": "是",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8401": "NIKOLAI: 他在那儿，抱歉，要是他刚才——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8402": "NIKOLAI: ……米勒？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8403": "MUELLER: 班长？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8404": "MUELLER: 嘿，瞧瞧，你还真活着。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8405": "MUELLER: 天，你看着比失踪前还精神。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8406": "NIKOLAI: 还有别的熟人在这儿吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8407": "MUELLER: 大概没了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8408": "MUELLER: 魏斯踩了诡雷，被炸得不成样子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8409": "MUELLER: 我们想把他抬出去，用篷布裹住，免得里面的东西都流出来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8410": "MUELLER: 可他连那一晚都没撑过去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8411": "MUELLER: 那以后我申请调去前线，至少敌人在眼前，看得见。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8412": "MUELLER: 可就算这样，他们也不肯让我上火线，至少起初不肯。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8413": "MUELLER: 结果就只是驻守他们边境上的那些城镇。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8414": "MUELLER: 抓间谍，踹门，那些人也不怎么反抗。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8415": "MUELLER: 我们的人想拿什么就拿什么，街上看中哪个姑娘，直接抓走就是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8416": "MUELLER: 没人拦得住。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8417": "MAIMUN: 看来，有德之人还是一如既往地稀少。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8418": "MAIMUN: 别担心，其他人看不见我，也听不见我们的交谈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8419": "MAIMUN: 米勒先生正试着卸下良心上的重担，不过，看来并不顺利。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8420": "NIKOLAI: 你才是哲学家，可我不知道该对他说什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8421": "MAIMUN: 我想，你会发现，要劝动他非常困难。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8422": "MAIMUN: 习惯与偏好会遮住人的眼睛，不管事实如何，人们总是更愿意相信自己熟悉的那些说法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8423": "NIKOLAI: 那些事，你没做过吧，米勒？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8424": "MUELLER: 没有。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8425": "MUELLER: 我只是在等着被调去前线，我们损失了那么多人，我知道迟早会轮到我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8426": "NIKOLAI: 听起来，你心里还是放不下。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8427": "MUELLER: 什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8428": "MUELLER: 我只做了自己该做的，又没在沟里枪杀平民。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8429": "MUELLER: 要是人人都像我这样打仗……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8430": "MAIMUN: 啊，又是这套老话，奥斯伦人最爱说的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8431": "MAIMUN: “要是人人都像我一样，世界就完美了！”",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8432": "MAIMUN: 想让奥斯伦人承认自己不是完美的楷模，根本没指望。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8433": "MAIMUN: 但你也许能让他明白，世上的其他人，并不会都以他为榜样。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8434": "NIKOLAI: 听着。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8435": "NIKOLAI: 要说我学到了什么，那就是……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8436": "MAIMUN: 对大多数人来说，借故事说理，比直截了当地解释更容易听进去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8437": "NIKOLAI: 假设你回到家，在自己的农场里，邻居的房子和田地着火了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8438": "NIKOLAI: 你会站在那里说：“不关我的事，我又没把自己的农场点着！”",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8439": "NIKOLAI: 还是会去帮邻居？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8440": "MUELLER: 不知道，我又不是在农场长大的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-muellerScene-8441": "NIKOLAI: 祝你明天好运，米勒。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeBattleStart-8442": "AGATA: 什么声音？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeBattleStart-8443": "NIKOLAI: 第一轮齐射，退后，别被弹片打中。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeBattleStart-8444": "NIKOLAI: 嗯，他们没有重炮，看看我们能做些什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeBattleStart-8445": "SOLDIER: 北侧发现多名敌军！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeBattleStart-8446": "NIKOLAI: 跟上！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeNorthBattle-8447": "SOLDIER: 增援！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeNorthBattle-8448": "SOLDIER: 西面有敌！需要支援！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeWestBattle-8449": "OFFICER: 是新来的那帮人！开火！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeSouthShout-8450": "SOLDIER: 南面有敌！正穿过树林！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeSouthBattle-8451": "SOLDIER: 他们来了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeFrontCall-8452": "ALTMAYER: 普罗赫！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeFrontCall-8453": "ALTMAYER: 东侧入口需要你！马上！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-thermeFrontCall-8454": "NIKOLAI: 这就是重头戏了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-louTalker-8455": "LIEUTENANT: 有人中弹吗！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-battleThermeFrontGate-8456": "ALTMAYER: 普罗赫！侧翼需要你！快回去！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-battleThermeFrontGate-8457": "ALTMAYER: 他们的主力来了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-battleThermeFrontGate-8458": "NIKOLAI: 这就结束了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-battleThermeFrontGate-8459": "ALTMAYER: 已经够受的了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-battleThermeFrontGate-8460": "LIEUTENANT: 长官，侧翼也没有敌军。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-battleThermeFrontGate-8461": "ALTMAYER: 我们做到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-battleThermeFrontGate-8462": "ALTMAYER: 弟兄们，为自己感到骄傲吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-battleThermeFrontGate-8463": "ALTMAYER: 不管这场战争还会怎样，都该为今天在这里的表现感到骄傲。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-battleThermeFrontGate-8464": "AGATA: 就我们看到的情况，敌军正在撤走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-battleThermeFrontGate-8465": "NIKOLAI: 也合理。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-battleThermeFrontGate-8466": "NIKOLAI: 说到底，这里没什么值得他们继续争下去的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-battleThermeFrontGate-8467": "NIKOLAI: 他们会把目标转向更重要的地方。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-battleThermeFrontGate-8468": "ALTMAYER: 那你呢？还会继续保卫祖国吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-battleThermeFrontGate-8469": "NIKOLAI: 当然会，我会对付它最大的敌人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-battleThermeFrontGate-8470": "NIKOLAI: 相信我，等事情办成了，你们自然会知道。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-battleThermeFrontGate-8471": "NIKOLAI: 好了，我们还有任务。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-AltmayerN-8472": "ALTMAYER: 我不知道历史会怎样评价这场战争，又会怎样评价我们，不过我心里很担忧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-blockingWestLt-8473": "LIEUTENANT: 守住这里！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-battleSouthA-8474": "SOLDIER: 我们不会离开这个战斗位置。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-battleSouthB-8475": "SOLDIER: 我们在支援前线。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-battleSouthC-8476": "SOLDIER: 随时可能来……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-battleSouthC2-8477": "SOLDIER: 应该不用等太久了吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/nikolaiQuest.yarn-battleSouthD-8478": "SOLDIER: 已经干掉他们几个了，算我们走运。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3486": "Title: 重返前线",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3487": "Description: 前往尼古拉世界的瑟尔梅，了解战况。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3488": "Title: 围困之中",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3489": "Description: 前往瑟尔梅，查看发生了什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3490": "Title: 上校",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3491": "Description: 向瑟尔梅旅店外的上校报到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3492": "Title: 归家",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3493": "Description: 前往家里的面包店，探望尼古拉的父亲。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3494": "Title: 不算命令",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3495": "Description: 再去旅店找阿尔特迈尔。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3496": "Title: 向山上去",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3497": "Description: 从瑟尔梅向西出发，寻找阿尔特迈尔的侦察兵。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3498": "Title: 噩耗的信使",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3499": "Description: 返回瑟尔梅，向上校报告。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3500": "Title: 风暴前夕",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3501": "Description: 在尼古拉家中休息。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3502": "Title: 开战！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3503": "Description: 守卫瑟尔梅，抵御卢斯基亚人的进攻！"
}
